WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:08.925 line:85%
I was the very first robot rover on another planet, and I was only about 30 centimeters tall, the length of a school ruler!

2
00:00:09.015 --> 00:00:10.214 line:85%
I'm Sojourner.

3
00:00:10.304 --> 00:00:17.355 line:85%
My lander, Pathfinder, touched down on Mars on July 4, 1997.

4
00:00:17.445 --> 00:00:22.035 line:85%
The next day, I stood up and rolled down a ramp onto the red ground.

5
00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.760 line:85%
Every day, I drove slowly to the rocks to study them.

6
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:32.495 line:85%
Together, we sent home 16,500 lander pictures and 550 of mine!

7
00:00:32.585 --> 00:00:35.580 line:85%
If you had a tiny rover, where would you send it?
